# Directional layout constraints

In Cartography constraints, always use semantic directional anchors:

- Use `leading` instead of `left`.
- Use `trailing` instead of `right`.

This applies to all new and modified Swift views, including constraints between
subviews and containers. Do not change unrelated UIKit properties or APIs that
are not layout constraints.
